{"title":"Trace Explorer workflow","type":"markdown","params":{"markdown":"**Workflow:** choose a trace group, click a trace to pin its `traceId`, then click any waterfall row for span details. [Follow latest / clear the pinned trace](/app/dashboards#/view/eshop-trace-explorer-dashboard).

